{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"publication\": {\n    \"ref\": \"PMID:38101024; DOI:10.1016/j.parkreldis.2023.105952; PMCID:PMC10872230\",\n    \"title\": \"Subthalamic Functional Connectivity Associated with Freezing of Gait Dopa-Response\",\n    \"publication_status\": \"published\",\n    \"version_of_candidate\": null,\n    \"study_id_candidate\": \"PMID:38101024_MUSC_prospective_cross_sectional_rs_fMRI\",\n    \"cohort_id_candidate\": \"MUSC_PD_FOG_cohort_possible_overlap_with_PMID:34102418\",\n    \"cohort_relation_basis\": \"本文明确指出，参与者纳入和排除标准的详细信息此前已发表，且该队列中PD-FOG与PD non-FOG组间差异此前已发表，均引用参考文献[12]。参考文献[12]为Lench DH等2021年发表的Paired inhibitory stimulation and gait training modulates supplemental motor area connectivity in freezing of gait，PMID:34102418，DOI:10.1016/j.parkreldis.2021.05.028。因此存在队列重叠的直接文字依据，但没有患者级ID、招募时间或样本交叉表，不能认定两篇论文使用完全相同的患者或完整重叠队列。\",\n    \"source_type\": \"primary\",\n    \"basis\": \"fulltext\",\n    \"fulltext_checked\": true\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E01\",\n      \"design\": \"前瞻性、横断面、观察性静息态功能磁共振成像研究；STN seed-to-voxel全脑功能连接分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"帕金森病伴FOG患者，dopa-responsive FOG组n=22，与dopa-unresponsive FOG组n=16比较。PD诊断依据UK Brain Bank Criteria。FOG依据nFOGQ报告冻结或UPDRS Item-14评分≥1判定，并由运动障碍专科医师确认。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 38,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"全文未单独报告该影像对比的最终有效分析人数及有效BOLD数据人数。n_FOG_events和n_trials不适用：没有事件锁定的自然行走记录或试次分析。n_electrodes_contacts不适用：未进行电极或植入式神经电生理记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；未区分akinetic、trembling-in-place、kinetic-no-trembling等亚型。研究使用临床FOG表型和dopa-response分组。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"ONOFF-FOG；两组均在OFF状态存在FOG，响应组在ON状态改善，非响应组在ON状态仍存在明显FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI全部在medication ON状态采集。dopa-response分组依据运动障碍专科医师观察药物ON相对于OFF状态的冻结行为改善。扫描时具体药物、剂量及服药至扫描的时间未报告。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"研究未实施DBS干预或刺激。受试者既往DBS植入状态未报告。刺激频率、幅度、脉宽、触点和方向性均无报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI，受试者注视十字。扫描持续4分30秒，119个volume，TR=2200 ms。不是直行、转弯、启动、双任务或实际FOG事件同步记录任务。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"右侧STN，使用AAL atlas定义的STN seed，分析其与全脑BOLD信号的功能连接。不是STN局部电生理记录。\",\n      \"measure\": \"右STN seed-to-voxel静息态BOLD功能连接强度。采用功能连接相关系数及Fisher转换后的z值，比较dopa-responsive与dopa-unresponsive FOG患者。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD时间序列带通滤波0.008–0.09 Hz；使用完整4分30秒静息态扫描。GLM采用voxel-level p<0.01，cluster-level FWE校正p<0.05。\",\n      \"finding\": \"dopa-responsive FOG患者的右STN与左侧小脑蚓部（left cerebellar vermis）功能连接显著强于dopa-unresponsive FOG患者。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"cluster-level FWE校正p=0.0182；cluster size=237 voxels；峰值MNI坐标(-8,-50,-16)。未报告两组连接强度差值、标准化效应量或置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级组间GLM分析；协变量包括年龄、病程和左旋多巴等效日剂量（LEDD）。采用cluster-level FWE校正。未报告该直接组间对比的精确有效样本数。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究领域级初评。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心MUSC队列；详细纳入排除标准转引既往研究[12]，本文未完整报告招募和流失流程。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG由nFOGQ或UPDRS Item-14界定，且有运动障碍专科医师确认；但神经影像没有与实际冻结事件同步的事件级标签。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用头动校正、ART异常扫描识别和去噪；但作者承认3 mm BOLD空间分辨率相对于STN较大，不能排除partial voluming。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"调整年龄、病程和LEDD，但响应组与非响应组年龄及病程存在差异，其他潜在混杂因素未被充分评估。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics；Results—Characterizing Dopa-Responsive FOG\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"主要推断基于患者级功能连接数据及患者间比较，没有将FOG事件或步态试次作为独立患者样本重复计数。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用cluster-level FWE校正，但后续连接与临床评分相关分析使用同一数据中筛选出的显著cluster，存在分析选择和独立验证不足的问题。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics；Results—STN Connectivity\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"未建立预测模型，亦未报告独立外部验证；该研究主要进行关联分析。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"本文未提供可核查的预注册分析计划或完整预设结局清单。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是STN与小脑的静息态BOLD功能连接证据，不是STN局部LFP、单单位、多单位活动或神经振荡证据。没有自然行走时的事件级FOG记录，不能确定连接变化发生于冻结前、冻结中还是恢复期。扫描只在药物ON状态完成。作者明确指出STN相对于BOLD空间分辨率较小，存在部分容积效应的可能。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Right STN connectivity to the left cerebellar vermis was significantly lower in the dopa-unresponsive FOG group relative to the dopa-responsive group.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—STN Connectivity: Dopa-Response versus Dopa-Unresponsive FOG\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Table 2; Figure 1\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E02\",\n      \"design\": \"前瞻性、横断面、观察性静息态fMRI研究；STN seed-to-voxel全脑功能连接分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"PD dopa-responsive FOG患者n=22与dopa-unresponsive FOG患者n=16。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 38,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"全文未单独报告该影像对比的最终有效分析人数及有效BOLD数据人数。FOG事件和试次数不适用；无电极记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；未区分FOG运动学亚型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"ONOFF-FOG；比较药物响应性不同的两组FOG患者。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集；dopa-response分组依据临床ON与OFF状态的冻结行为变化。具体药物和扫描前剂量时间未报告。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"无DBS刺激干预；既往DBS状态未报告；刺激参数不适用或未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"注视十字的静息态fMRI，4分30秒，119 volumes，TR=2200 ms；无步行任务。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"右侧STN AAL atlas seed；全脑BOLD功能连接。\",\n      \"measure\": \"右STN与左侧inferior temporal gyrus/lateral occipital cortex之间的静息态功能连接。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整4分30秒静息态扫描；voxel p<0.01，cluster-level FWE p<0.05。\",\n      \"finding\": \"dopa-responsive FOG患者右STN与左侧下颞回/外侧枕叶皮层的功能连接强于dopa-unresponsive FOG患者。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"cluster-level FWE校正p=0.0159；cluster size=242 voxels；峰值MNI坐标(-54,-72,-12)。连接强度差值及置信区间未报告。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级GLM组间比较；调整年龄、病程和LEDD；cluster-level FWE校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心样本；详细纳入排除标准引用既往研究[12]。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"有临床医师确认FOG，但无与BOLD信号同步的事件级冻结标签。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用头动校正和去噪，但作者承认STN相对3 mm BOLD分辨率较小，不能排除部分容积效应。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"调整年龄、病程和LEDD，但不能排除其他未测量混杂。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"以患者级连接值进行组间分析，无事件或试次级伪重复。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"组间cluster采用FWE校正，但同一数据中筛选的显著cluster用于后续关联分析。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型或独立外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告预注册分析计划或完整预设结局清单。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"反映静息态BOLD功能连接而非STN局部神经活动。没有实际FOG事件与连接信号的时间对应关系；扫描仅在ON状态进行。作者指出空间分辨率和部分容积效应可能影响STN信号解释。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Right STN connectivity to the left inferior temporal gyrus/lateral occipital cortex was significantly lower in the dopa-unresponsive FOG group relative to the dopa-responsive group.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—STN Connectivity: Dopa-Response versus Dopa-Unresponsive FOG\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Table 2; Figure 1\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E03\",\n      \"design\": \"前瞻性、横断面、观察性静息态fMRI研究；STN seed-to-voxel功能连接分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"PD dopa-responsive FOG患者n=22与dopa-unresponsive FOG患者n=16。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 38,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"全文未单独报告最终有效影像样本数；无事件级FOG计数、试次或电极记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；没有按akinetic或trembling-in-place分类。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"ONOFF-FOG；dopa-responsive与dopa-unresponsive FOG患者。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"fMRI在medication ON状态采集；临床分组根据OFF至ON冻结表现改变。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"无DBS干预；既往植入状态未报告；无刺激参数。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI，注视十字，4分30秒，119 volumes，TR=2200 ms。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"左侧STN AAL atlas seed；全脑BOLD。\",\n      \"measure\": \"左STN与左侧lateral occipital cortex的静息态功能连接强度。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描；voxel p<0.01，cluster-level FWE p<0.05。\",\n      \"finding\": \"dopa-responsive FOG患者左STN与左侧外侧枕叶皮层的功能连接显著强于dopa-unresponsive FOG患者。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"cluster-level FWE校正p=0.0030；cluster size=302 voxels；峰值MNI坐标(-52,-74,26)。未报告连接差值和置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级GLM；调整年龄、病程及LEDD；cluster-level FWE校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心样本，纳排标准细节转引参考文献[12]。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"有临床医师确认FOG，但没有神经信号与实际冻结事件同步的标签。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用标准去噪及头动校正，但存在STN空间分辨率不足和部分容积效应问题。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"调整年龄、病程和LEDD，不能排除其他混杂因素。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"以患者为统计单位进行连接强度分析。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"组间比较使用cluster-level FWE，但后续相关分析使用同一数据筛选出的显著区域。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"未建立预测模型，未报告外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有可核查的预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是静息态BOLD功能连接结果，不是STN局部神经振荡或电生理活动。没有事件级FOG记录。扫描仅在药物ON状态完成，且作者承认STN空间分辨率和部分容积效应限制。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Left STN connectivity to the lateral occipital cortex was significantly greater in the dopa-responsive FOG group.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—STN Connectivity: Dopa-Response versus Dopa-Unresponsive FOG\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Table 2; Figure 1\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E04\",\n      \"design\": \"前瞻性、横断面、观察性静息态fMRI研究；STN seed-to-voxel功能连接分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"PD dopa-responsive FOG患者n=22与dopa-unresponsive FOG患者n=16。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 38,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"最终有效影像分析人数未单独报告；没有事件级冻结记录、试次或电极数据。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；没有报告具体FOG运动学亚型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"ONOFF-FOG；药物响应性不同的两组FOG患者。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集；临床分组依据药物OFF和ON状态的冻结改善情况。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"未进行DBS刺激；既往DBS状态未知；无刺激参数。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI，注视十字，4分30秒，119 volumes，TR=2200 ms。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"左侧STN AAL atlas seed；全脑BOLD。\",\n      \"measure\": \"左STN与左侧postcentral gyrus（中央后回）的静息态功能连接。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描；voxel p<0.01，cluster-level FWE p<0.05。\",\n      \"finding\": \"dopa-unresponsive FOG患者左STN与左侧中央后回的功能连接显著强于dopa-responsive FOG患者。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"cluster-level FWE校正p<0.0001；cluster size=606 voxels；峰值MNI坐标(-28,-28,74)。未报告连接差值或置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级GLM，调整年龄、病程和LEDD；cluster-level FWE校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心招募，详细纳排标准引用既往研究[12]。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"临床医师确认FOG，但没有事件级神经影像标签。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"虽然进行了头动处理和去噪，但作者承认BOLD分辨率相对于STN较低。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"调整年龄、病程及LEDD，但仍可能存在残余混杂。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者级功能连接数据用于组间推断，无事件级伪重复。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用cluster-level FWE，但后续相关分析使用同一数据中的显著cluster。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"未进行预测建模或外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未提供预注册或完整预设分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"中央后回连接增强是组间静息态BOLD连接差异，不能直接等同于感觉输入异常、STN beta增强或冻结事件期间的神经活动。无事件级记录，且扫描仅在ON状态。\",\n      \"quote\": \"connectivity to a region within the postcentral gyrus was significantly greater in the dopa-unresponsive FOG group.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—STN Connectivity: Dopa-Response versus Dopa-Unresponsive FOG\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Table 2; Figure 1\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E05\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性静息态fMRI；PD non-FOG对照与dopa-responsive FOG组的连接强度比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"PD non-FOG controls n=17，与dopa-responsive FOG患者n=22比较。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 22,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"本文未单独报告该影像比较的有效样本数；无FOG事件计数、步态试次和电极数据。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"FOG比较组为ONOFF-FOG；对照组为PD non-FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"所有静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"未进行DBS干预；既往植入状态未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"注视十字的静息态fMRI；4分30秒，119 volumes，TR=2200 ms。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"右侧STN AAL atlas seed与左侧小脑蚓部。\",\n      \"measure\": \"右STN-左侧小脑蚓部静息态功能连接；比较Fisher-transformed z-scores。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描。\",\n      \"finding\": \"PD non-FOG对照与dopa-responsive FOG患者之间的右STN-小脑连接没有显著差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"t=1.37，df=37，p=0.1787。未报告效应量和置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级Fisher-transformed z-score；two-sample t-test。该控制组比较未在该段说明额外协变量调整。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心PD样本；详细纳排标准转引既往文献[12]。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG组有临床确认，但未进行同步事件级冻结记录。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了头动校正和去噪，但STN空间分辨率限制由作者明确承认。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"观察性比较，未在该对照比较中明确说明完整协变量调整。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用患者级连接z-score进行两组比较。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"对照比较进行了多个cluster的t检验，本文未说明这些比较的多重检验校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未提供预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"本结果只说明在该静息态BOLD连接指标上没有检出显著差异，不等于两组连接完全相同。扫描仅在ON状态；无实际FOG事件级神经数据。\",\n      \"quote\": \"PD control and dopa-responsive FOG groups did not differ in STN-cerebellar connectivity (t=1.37, df=37, p=0.1787).\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 2\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E06\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性静息态fMRI；PD non-FOG对照与dopa-unresponsive FOG组的连接强度比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"PD non-FOG controls n=17，与dopa-unresponsive FOG患者n=16比较。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 16,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"最终影像分析人数未单独报告；FOG事件、试次和电极数据不适用。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"FOG组为ONOFF-FOG，且被分类为dopa-unresponsive；对照组为PD non-FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"无DBS干预；既往植入状态未知。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI，注视十字；4分30秒，119 volumes，TR=2200 ms。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"右侧STN AAL atlas seed与左侧小脑蚓部。\",\n      \"measure\": \"右STN-左侧小脑蚓部功能连接，Fisher-transformed z-scores。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描。\",\n      \"finding\": \"dopa-unresponsive FOG组相对于PD non-FOG对照组表现出显著更负的右STN-小脑连接值。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"t=2.68，df=31，p=0.0116。未报告效应量和置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级Fisher-transformed z-scores；two-sample t-test。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心样本，详细纳排标准转引既往研究[12]。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG由问卷和临床评分定义并经专科医师确认，但无事件级神经记录。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"有标准预处理，但STN空间分辨率和部分容积效应存在限制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"观察性对照比较，未明确说明该t检验调整所有潜在混杂因素。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"以患者级连接值为单位进行比较。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多个连接区域进行对照比较，未报告该组t检验的多重校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"无预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告预注册或预设分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果是静息态BOLD连接的组间差异，不是冻结事件期间的小脑-STN神经同步证据。更负的连接值不能直接等同于神经抑制或某一特定振荡增强。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the dopa-unresponsive group had significantly more negative connectivity values than PD controls (t=2.68, df=31, p=0.0116).\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 2\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E07\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性静息态fMRI；PD non-FOG对照与dopa-responsive FOG组的连接比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"PD non-FOG controls n=17与dopa-responsive FOG患者n=22。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 22,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"影像比较的最终有效样本数未单独列出；无事件级冻结、试次或电极记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"FOG组为ONOFF-FOG；PD对照组无FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"fMRI在medication ON状态采集。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"未实施DBS；既往DBS状态未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"注视十字的静息态fMRI；4分30秒，119 volumes，TR=2200 ms。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"左STN AAL atlas seed与左侧postcentral gyrus。\",\n      \"measure\": \"左STN-左侧中央后回功能连接，Fisher-transformed z-scores。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描。\",\n      \"finding\": \"PD non-FOG对照与dopa-responsive FOG患者之间，左STN-中央后回功能连接没有显著差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"t=1.271，df=37，p=0.179。未报告效应量和置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级Fisher-transformed z-scores；two-sample t-test。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心队列，纳排细节转引既往研究[12]。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"临床确认FOG，但无事件级冻结记录。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了头动校正，但作者承认BOLD分辨率限制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"对照t检验未明确说明完整协变量调整。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者级连接值作为统计单位。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多个连接区域进行对照比较，未明确报告该组检验的多重校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"无预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"不显著结果不证明两组功能连接完全等同。没有实际步态冻结事件记录，且影像采集只在药物ON状态完成。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Left STN connectivity with the postcentral cluster did not differ between PD controls and the dopa-responsive FOG group (t=1.271, df=37, p=0.179).\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 2\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E08\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性静息态fMRI；PD non-FOG对照与dopa-unresponsive FOG组的连接比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"PD non-FOG controls n=17与dopa-unresponsive FOG患者n=16。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 16,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"最终影像分析人数未单独报告；没有事件级FOG、试次和电极记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"FOG组为ONOFF-FOG且dopa-unresponsive；对照组无FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"无DBS干预；既往植入状态未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI，注视十字，4分30秒，119 volumes，TR=2200 ms。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"左STN AAL atlas seed与左侧postcentral gyrus。\",\n      \"measure\": \"左STN-中央后回静息态功能连接，Fisher-transformed z-scores。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描。\",\n      \"finding\": \"dopa-unresponsive FOG组的左STN-中央后回连接显著高于PD non-FOG对照组。\",\n      \"e