her-transformed z-scores；two-sample t-test。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心样本，纳排细节引用既往研究[12]。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG经临床确认，但无事件级冻结记录。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"标准头动校正及去噪，但存在STN空间分辨率限制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"对照比较没有明确说明完整混杂调整。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者级功能连接值用于统计。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多个连接cluster进行t检验，未说明对照比较的多重校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"无预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"不显著不等于两组连接相等，也不能排除其他脑区或其他神经指标存在差异。\",\n      \"quote\": \"did not differ with the dopa-unresponsive FOG group (t=0.966, df=31, p=0.342).\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 2\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E11\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性静息态fMRI；PD non-FOG对照与dopa-responsive FOG组的连接比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"PD non-FOG controls n=17与dopa-responsive FOG患者n=22。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 22,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"最终有效影像分析人数未单独报告；无事件、试次或电极记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"FOG组为ONOFF-FOG；对照组无FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"未进行DBS干预；既往DBS状态未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI，注视十字，4分30秒，119 volumes，TR=2200 ms。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"右STN AAL atlas seed与左侧occipital cluster。\",\n      \"measure\": \"右STN-左侧枕叶cluster功能连接，Fisher-transformed z-scores。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描。\",\n      \"finding\": \"PD non-FOG对照与dopa-responsive FOG组的右STN-左侧枕叶连接没有显著差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"t=1.302，df=37，p=0.201。未报告效应量和置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级Fisher-transformed z-scores；two-sample t-test。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心招募，详细纳排标准转引[12]。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG经临床确认，但没有事件级冻结记录。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了头动校正，但作者指出STN空间分辨率限制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"该对照t检验未明确报告全部混杂因素调整。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用患者级连接值进行比较。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多个连接区域进行比较，但该组t检验未明确报告多重校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"未建立预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"不显著结果不能解释为连接完全相同；该指标是静息态BOLD功能连接，而不是冻结期间的局部STN活动。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Right STN connectivity with the left occipital cluster did not significantly differ between PD controls and dopa-responsive (t=1.302, df=37, p=0.201).\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 2\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E12\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性静息态fMRI；PD non-FOG对照与dopa-unresponsive FOG组的连接比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"PD non-FOG controls n=17与dopa-unresponsive FOG患者n=16。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 16,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"最终有效影像分析人数未单独报告；无事件、试次或电极数据。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"FOG组为ONOFF-FOG且dopa-unresponsive；对照组无FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"无DBS刺激；既往植入状态未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI，注视十字，4分30秒，119 volumes，TR=2200 ms。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"右STN AAL atlas seed与左侧occipital cluster。\",\n      \"measure\": \"右STN-左侧枕叶cluster静息态功能连接，Fisher-transformed z-scores。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描。\",\n      \"finding\": \"PD non-FOG对照与dopa-unresponsive FOG组的右STN-左侧枕叶连接没有显著差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"t=1.123，df=31，p=0.270。未报告效应量和置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级Fisher-transformed z-scores；two-sample t-test。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心样本，纳排标准转引既往研究[12]。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"临床确认FOG，但没有事件级同步记录。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"标准去噪及头动校正，但STN空间分辨率存在限制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"对照比较没有明确报告全部混杂因素调整。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者级连接值用于统计。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了多个连接区域的对照检验，但未报告这些检验的多重校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"无预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未提供预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"不显著差异不能证明两组连接相同，也不能排除其他STN连接区域的差异。\",\n      \"quote\": \"or unresponsive FOG group (t=1.123, df=31, p=0.270).\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—STN Connectivity Relative to PD Controls\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 2\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E13\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性神经影像-临床表型相关研究；患者级partial Spearman相关分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"38名FOG患者中，35名有定量UPDRS Item-14 ON/OFF变化评分；包含dopa-responsive和dopa-unresponsive FOG患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 35,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 35,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"35名FOG患者的dopa-response有定量UPDRS Item-14变化评分，原文明确报告。有效影像数据最终人数没有独立列出。FOG事件数和试次数不适用；无电极记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；采用UPDRS Item-14量化冻结严重程度变化。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"ONOFF-FOG；分析FOG患者对左旋多巴治疗的临床反应程度。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集；临床FOG反应评分比较药物ON与OFF状态。具体药物剂量和两次评估间隔未报告。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"无DBS刺激干预；既往DBS状态未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI，注视十字。临床结局为药物ON与OFF状态UPDRS Item-14变化；非神经记录期间实际冻结事件。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"右侧STN AAL atlas seed与左侧小脑蚓部。\",\n      \"measure\": \"右STN-小脑功能连接强度与UPDRS Item-14 ON/OFF变化评分之间的相关性。连接强度使用显著cluster内平均beta值及Fisher-transformed correlation coefficient表示。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整4分30秒静息态扫描。Spearman相关在年龄、病程和LEDD线性回归残差上计算；四项相关采用Bonferroni校正，阈值p<0.0125。\",\n      \"finding\": \"右STN-小脑功能连接强度与药物诱导的UPDRS Item-14变化呈正相关。作者解释为较强STN-小脑连接与较大的FOG药物反应相关。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Spearman partial correlation ρ=0.419，p=0.0122；通过四项相关的Bonferroni阈值0.0125。未报告置信区间。ON/OFF变化分数的具体减法方向未在本文明确说明。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级相关分析；对年龄、病程和LEDD进行线性回归后，对残差进行Spearman相关；四项相关采用Bonferroni校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心队列；35/38 FOG患者有定量UPDRS Item-14变化评分，缺失3人。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"UPDRS Item-14用于定量FOG反应，评分是在ON/OFF评估后获得；不是与神经信号同步的事件级冻结测量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"经过标准预处理和头动校正，但STN空间分辨率及部分容积效应存在限制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"调整年龄、病程和LEDD，但其他混杂因素仍可能影响连接和药物反应。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"以患者为单位进行相关分析，而不是把冻结事件或试次作为独立样本。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"四项相关采用Bonferroni校正，但相关区域是在同一数据集的组间显著cluster中选取。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics；Results—Relationship Between STN-CLR Connectivity and Degree of Dopa-Response\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型或独立验证队列。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未提供预注册的相关分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"连接测量来自药物ON状态的静息态fMRI，FOG结局是ON/OFF UPDRS Item-14变化而非事件级冻结次数。该结果不能确定小脑-STN连接在FOG发生前或发生时的动态变化。相关不代表因果。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the right STN and cerebellum (ρ=0.419, p=0.0122) were correlated with change in FOG severity\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Relationship Between STN-CLR Connectivity and Degree of Dopa-Response\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 3\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E14\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性神经影像-临床表型相关研究；患者级partial Spearman相关分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"有定量UPDRS Item-14变化评分的FOG患者；35/38名FOG患者具有该定量评分。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 35,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 35,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"原文报告35名FOG患者有定量Item-14变化评分；有效影像人数未单独列出。没有事件计数、试次或电极记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"ONOFF-FOG；dopa-response通过ON/OFF UPDRS Item-14变化量化。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集；临床评分比较ON与OFF状态。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"未进行DBS干预；既往DBS状态未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI；临床药物挑战前后UPDRS Item-14评分比较。无事件级FOG神经记录。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"左STN AAL atlas seed与左侧postcentral gyrus。\",\n      \"measure\": \"左STN-左侧中央后回功能连接强度与UPDRS Item-14 ON/OFF变化评分的相关性。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描。partial Spearman相关；年龄、病程、LEDD残差调整；Bonferroni阈值0.0125。\",\n      \"finding\": \"左STN-中央后回功能连接与UPDRS Item-14变化呈负相关。作者认为较强的该连接与较低的FOG药物反应相关。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Spearman partial correlation ρ=-0.432，p=0.0096；通过Bonferroni校正阈值0.0125。置信区间未报告。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级partial Spearman相关；先回归调整年龄、病程和LEDD，再对残差进行相关分析；Bonferroni校正四项相关。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心队列，FOG定量反应仅在35/38患者中获得。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用UPDRS Item-14变化量化药物反应，没有与BOLD同步的实际冻结事件记录。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"有标准去噪和头动校正，但STN空间分辨率较低。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"调整年龄、病程和LEDD，其他潜在混杂仍无法排除。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者级相关分析，没有将事件或试次当作独立患者。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"四项相关采用Bonferroni校正，但使用同一数据集筛选的显著cluster。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"未建立预测模型，也没有外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"负相关反映患者间静息态连接与临床药物反应评分之间的关联，不是冻结事件期间的中央后回神经活动增强证据。无法区分感觉整合、运动准备或其他网络机制。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the left STN and left postcentral gyrus (ρ=−.432, p=0.0096) were correlated with change in FOG severity\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Relationship Between STN-CLR Connectivity and Degree of Dopa-Response\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 3\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E15\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性神经影像-临床表型相关研究；患者级partial Spearman相关分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"有定量UPDRS Item-14变化评分的FOG患者；原文报告35/38名FOG患者有该评分。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 35,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 35,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"35名FOG患者有定量Item-14评分；最终有效影像样本数未单独报告。无事件、试次或电极数据。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"ONOFF-FOG；按药物ON/OFF的FOG变化量化响应。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集；临床评分为药物ON与OFF状态变化。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"未进行DBS刺激；既往DBS状态未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI；UPDRS Item-14临床药物反应评分；没有神经记录期间的实际FOG任务。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"左STN AAL atlas seed与左侧occipital gyrus/cluster。\",\n      \"measure\": \"左STN-左侧枕叶功能连接强度与UPDRS Item-14 ON/OFF变化的相关性。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描；partial Spearman相关；调整年龄、病程、LEDD；Bonferroni阈值0.0125。\",\n      \"finding\": \"左STN-左侧枕叶功能连接强度与FOG药物反应评分呈正相关。作者解释为较强连接与较大的FOG药物改善相关。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Spearman partial correlation ρ=0.501，p=0.0022；通过Bonferroni校正。置信区间未报告。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级partial Spearman相关；使用年龄、病程和LEDD回归残差；Bonferroni校正四项相关。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心队列，只有35/38名FOG患者有定量Item-14反应数据。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"临床结局采用UPDRS Item-14变化，没有事件级神经信号标签。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用标准预处理，但存在STN空间分辨率及部分容积效应限制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"调整年龄、病程、LEDD，但残余混杂不能排除。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用患者级连接值和患者级临床评分。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用四项相关的Bonferroni校正，但相关区域源自同一数据集的显著组间cluster。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型或独立验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果是静息态功能连接与临床FOG药物反应之间的患者级相关，不是枕叶活动导致冻结改善的因果证据。没有事件级步态记录。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the left STN and left occipital gyrus (ρ=.501, p=0.0022) were correlated with change in FOG severity\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Relationship Between STN-CLR Connectivity and Degree of Dopa-Response\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 3\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E16\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性神经影像-临床表型相关研究；患者级partial Spearman相关分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"有定量UPDRS Item-14变化评分的FOG患者；原文报告35/38名FOG患者有该评分。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 35,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 35,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"35名FOG患者有定量Item-14评分；最终有效影像数据人数未独立列出。无事件、试次或电极记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"ONOFF-FOG；按药物ON/OFF时FOG变化量化响应。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集；临床FOG反应比较药物ON和OFF状态。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"未实施DBS；既往DBS植入状态未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI；UPDRS Item-14药物反应评分；非事件级步态任务。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"右STN AAL atlas seed与左侧occipital cluster。\",\n      \"measure\": \"右STN-左侧枕叶功能连接强度与UPDRS Item-14 ON/OFF变化评分的相关性。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描；partial Spearman相关；调整年龄、病程和LEDD；Bonferroni阈值0.0125。\",\n      \"finding\": \"右STN-左侧枕叶功能连接强度与UPDRS Item-14变化呈正相关。作者将其解释为较强连接与较大的FOG药物反应相关。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Spearman partial correlation ρ=0.516，p=0.0015；通过Bonferroni校正。未报告置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级partial Spearman相关；年龄、病程、LEDD残差调整；四项相关采用Bonferroni校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心样本；FOG定量反应仅在35/38患者中获得。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用UPDRS Item-14药物前后变化，不是事件级冻结测量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了头动校正和去噪，但作者指出STN空间分辨率限制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"调整年龄、病程和LEDD，但不能排除未测量混杂。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"以患者级数据进行相关分析。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"四项相关采用Bonferroni校正，但相关区域来自同一数据集筛选的显著cluster。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"未建立预测模型或外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未提供预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods；Results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果反映右STN-枕叶静息态功能连接与临床FOG药物反应之间的关联，不能证明视觉网络参与了特定冻结事件，也不能推断神经振荡方向。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the right STN and left occipital cluster (ρ=.516, p=0.0015) were correlated with change in FOG severity\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Relationship Between STN-CLR Connectivity and Degree of Dopa-Response\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 3\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E17\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性静息态fMRI与临床结局相关分析；患者级相关分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"FOG患者；作者报告STN显著cluster与整体运动评分变化的相关分析。该Part-III相关分析的具体有效样本数未单独报告。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"全文没有单独给出UPDRS Part-III相关分析的有效样本数、相关系数及p值。FOG事件和试次不适用；无电极数据。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"FOG患者ONOFF-FOG；本项结局为整体运动症状药物反应，而不是FOG特异性反应。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"静息态fMRI在medication ON状态采集；临床结局为UPDRS Part-III药物ON/OFF变化。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"未实施DBS；既往植入状态未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"静息态fMRI；临床UPDRS Part-III ON/OFF评分变化。无事件级步态冻结记录。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"右STN AAL atlas seed与左侧小脑蚓部。\",\n      \"measure\": \"右STN-小脑功能连接强度与UPDRS Part-III整体运动评分ON/OFF变化之间的相关性。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"BOLD bandpass 0.008–0.09 Hz；完整静息态扫描。作者称使用与FOG反应相关分析相同的连接cluster；具体本项统计参数未分别报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"右STN-小脑功能连接强度与UPDRS Part-III整体运动评分变化没有显著相关。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"作者报告not correlated；没有给出该项相关系数、p值、置信区间或效应量。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级相关分析；论文前述相关方法为调整年龄、病程和LEDD后的Spearman残差相关，但该项Part-III分析的具体N和统计值未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性神经影像关联研究。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心队列；本项相关分析的具体样本数未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Study Participants；Results—Relationship Between STN-CLR Connectivity and Degree of Dopa-Response\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"UPDRS Part-III是整体运动评分，不是事件级FOG测量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"标准预处理，但作者指出STN空间分辨率和部分容积效应限制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—MRI Data Collection and Preprocessing；Discussion—Limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"调整年龄、病程和LEDD，其他潜在混杂无法排除。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"分析基于患者级连接与临床评分。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Functional Connectivity Statistics\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG相关分析采用Bonferroni，但Part-III分析的独立校正和完整统计值未分别报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Relationship Between STN-CLR Connectivity and Degree of Dopa-Response\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"无预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical Analyses\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未提供预注册计划，且本项相关系数和p值未给出。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Relationship Between STN-CLR Connectivity and Degree of Dopa-Response\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"作者只报告无相关，没有提供具体统计量。该阴性结果不能证明该连接与整体运动反应绝对无关。与FOG特异性评分的相关结果相比，这一发现提示结局特异性，但不能直接证明神经机制只作用于FOG。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the strength of functional connectivity between the STN and these same clusters was not correlated with overall change in motor severity\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Relationship Between STN-CLR Connectivity and Degree of Dopa-Response\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 3\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E18\",\n      \"design\": \"横断面观察性静息态fMRI与临床结局相关分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"FOG患者；UPDRS Part-III整体运动评分变化与STN连接强度的相关分析。具体有效样本数未单独报告。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 55,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n    